<section id="model-diagnostics" class="panel model-diagnostics" {{#if oob}}hx-swap-oob="outerHTML"{{/if}}>
<div class="panel-header">
<div>
<h2>번역 동작 상태 <span class="badge {{status}}" data-model-state="{{status}}">{{status}}</span>
</h2>
<p>모델 <code>{{model}}</code> · 최근 요청 {{#if lastRequestAt}}<time datetime="{{lastRequestAt}}" data-format-time>{{lastRequestAt}}</time>{{else}}기록 없음{{/if}} {{lastRequestResult}}</p>
</div>{{> icon name="sparkles"}}</div>
<div class="model-key-status">
  <span>기본 키 <span class="badge {{keys.primary.state}}" data-model-key-state="{{keys.primary.state}}">{{keys.primary.state}}</span>{{#if keys.primary.retryAt}} · 재시도 <time datetime="{{keys.primary.retryAt}}" data-format-time>{{keys.primary.retryAt}}</time>{{/if}}</span>
  <span>대체 키 <span class="badge {{keys.fallback.state}}" data-model-key-state="{{keys.fallback.state}}">{{keys.fallback.state}}</span>{{#if keys.fallback.retryAt}} · 재시도 <time datetime="{{keys.fallback.retryAt}}" data-format-time>{{keys.fallback.retryAt}}</time>{{/if}}</span>
  <span>다음 요청: <strong data-active-model-key="{{keys.activeKey}}">{{keys.activeKey}}</strong></span>
</div>
<dl class="translation-metrics">
<div>
<dt>번역 성공</dt>
<dd>{{counts.success}}<span>회</span>
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>실패</dt>
<dd>{{counts.failed}}<span>회</span>
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>캐시 사용</dt>
<dd>{{counts.cache_hit}}<span>회</span>
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>건너뜀</dt>
<dd>{{counts.skipped}}<span>회</span>
</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<p class="model-settings-note">보존 기간 내 요청 기록 기준입니다. 기본 키는 PRIMARY_MODEL_API_KEY, 대체 키는 FALLBACK_MODEL_API_KEY로 설정하며 변경 후 재시작이 필요합니다.</p>
</section>
